ues to ensure your treatment is virtually pain-free. No discomfort, no anxiety — just safe, careful dental care.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Relaxed & Calm Environment</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Our clinic is designed to be calm, clean, and welcoming — from the moment you walk in, you will feel at ease in a safe and hygienic environment.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Everything Under One Roof</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">From general check-ups and fillings to dental implants, braces, root canals, and full-mouth rehabilitation — all 13 dental treatments are available under one roof.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Complete Hygiene & Patient Privacy</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Every instrument is thoroughly sterilized and clinic hygiene protocols strictly followed. Your safety is our top priority at every single visit.</p></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="wheel-block__triggers"><!--[--><div data-nr="1" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="2" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="3" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="4" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="5" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="6" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[--><div class="reveal-block about-apply"><div class="reveal-block__content"><div class="reveal-block__header u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title u-text-headings-large"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">This</span> <span c