<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Everything you need to know <span class="u-text-wine">before your visit.</span></h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Consultation &amp; Clinic Timings</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What are the clinic timings?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>We are open Monday to Saturday:<br><strong>Morning:</strong> 10:00 AM &ndash; 3:00 PM<br><strong>Evening:</strong> 6:30 PM &ndash; 9:30 PM<br><strong>Sunday:</strong> Closed.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Where is the clinic located in Nashik?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Shrivastava Dental Clinic is located at Shop No. Express Tower, Wadala Naka, near Hotel Saffron, Nashik - 422001.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Do I need to book an appointment in advance?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes, we recommend calling or WhatsApp-ing us on <strong>+91 7796376170</strong> to schedule an appointment. Walk-ins are also welcome for dental emergencies.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.3s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How do I contact the clinic?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p><strong>Phone/WhatsApp:</strong> +91 7796376170<br><strong>Email:</strong> kritiacshrivastava92@gmail.com</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Treatments &amp; Procedures</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What dental treatments are offered?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><ul class="list-bullet"><li style="" value="1">General &amp; Restorative Dentistry</li><li style="" value="2">Root Canal Treatments (Endodontics)</li><li style="" value="3">Cosmetic Dentistry</li><li style="" value="4">Dental Implants &amp; Prosthodontics</li><li style="" value="5">Orthodontic Treatments (Braces)</li><li style="" value="6">Oral &amp; Maxillofacial Surgery</li><li style="" value="7">Periodontics (Gum Treatments)</li><li style="" value="8">Paediatric Dentistry (Children)</li><li style="" value="9">Emergency Dental Treatments</li><li style="" value="10">Full-Mouth Rehabilitation</li></ul></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is root canal treatment painful?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>No. Modern root canal treatments are performed under proper local anaesthesia and are virtually painless. Most patients are surprised by how comfortable the procedure is.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Do you treat children?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes! We provide specialized Paediatric Dentistry in a gentle, friendly environment to make young patients feel comfortable and unafraid.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Comfort &amp; Emergency Care</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Do you handle dental emergencies?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes. If you have severe toothache, a broken tooth, or any dental emergency, call us immediately at <strong>+91 7796376170</strong> or WhatsApp us. We prioritize emergency cases promptly.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is the clinic environment hygienic and safe?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Absolutely. All instruments at Shrivastava Dental Clinic are sterilized using industry-standard protocols. We maintain strict hygiene standards at every visit.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.3s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">About the Clinic</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Who is the doctor at Shrivastava Dental Clinic?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The clinic is led by <strong>Dr. Kriti Shrivastava</strong>, Chief Dental Surgeon with Registration No. 1977. She specializes in comprehensive dental care with a gentle, patient-first approach.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What makes Shrivastava Dental Clinic different?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Personalized care, transparent treatment guidance, all 13 dental specialties under one roof, emergency availability, and a calm welcoming environment make us the first choice in Nashik.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div></section>
